# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify redirect rules.
#
# The site advertises a clean install URL:
#
#   curl -fsSL https://computer.police.dev/install | bash
#
# Hosts that read this file (Cloudflare Pages, Netlify, Render) will 302
# /install to the canonical script in the GitHub repository. curl -fsSL
# follows redirects, so the pipe-to-bash flow lands on the real script.
#
# If you self-host or use a host that does not read _redirects, replicate
# the same behaviour in your reverse proxy or check scripts/install.sh
# into site/install directly so it is served as a static file.

/install   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vidocsecurity/computer-police/main/scripts/install.sh   302
